 "steps": [
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Cut potatoes into <b><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"len\" data-u=\"mm\" data-a=\"18\" data-s=\"0\">18 mm</span> square batons</b>. Mix all brine ingredients until dissolved.</li><li>Bag <b><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"500\" data-s=\"0\">500 g</span> potatoes with <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"500\" data-s=\"0\">500 g</span> prepared brine</b> in one layer; a little brine remains. Seal without crushing, or clip the open pouch mouth above the bath.</li></ul>",
