   "title": "Cook the potatoes",
   "uses_rows": []
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Drain gently onto a rack. Cool and dry until no surface water remains.</li><li>Heat oil to <b><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"temp\" data-u=\"C\" data-a=\"130\" data-s=\"0\">130 °C</span></b>. Fry small batches about <b>8 minutes</b>, until the outside sets but stays pale. Drain on the rack. Keep the pot no more than half full.</li></ul>",
   "heat": {
    "label": "130 °C oil",
